  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Water, Sanitation and Hygiene in Rural Areas of Zimbabwe (Climate Change Fund and Capital spend)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Improving Water, Sanitation and Hygiene in Rural Areas of Zimbabwe (Climate Change Fund and Capital spend) is a component of Support to improved water and sanitation in rural areas - Zimbabwe reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;7,162,108. It works in the following sector(s): Basic drinking water supply, Environmental policy and administrative management, Basic sanitation, Water sector policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
